     1830   ON CHOOSE OF b-db IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1831   DO:
     1832   define variable ri as recid no-undo.
     1833   define buffer buf_db for ub.db.
     1834     run adm/dbs.w (
     1835                   input parparentproc
     1836                  ,input 'ПРОСМОТР':U
     1837                  ,output ri).
     1838     if ri <> ?
     1839     then do:
     1840       find buf_db where recid (buf_db) = ri .
     1841       display
     1842       buf_db.db-num @ tt-clients.db-num
     1843       with frame Dialog-Frame.
     1844     end.
     1845   END.
     1846   ON CHOOSE OF B-exit IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
