     3261               , input tt-shop.obj-code
     3262               , input 'holdfirm-code':U
     3263               , input string( fi-holdfirm-code )
     3264           ).
     3265       end.
     3266   end.
     3267   END PROCEDURE.
     3268   PROCEDURE reset-from-sysconf :
     3269   define  input parameter p-reset as logical no-undo.
